{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">兩隻新股首日掛牌，股價雙雙平開，並失守招股價。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-0945_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vzPnUwsQor1788237652.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-0945_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">快時尚平台希音開報48.56元，與招股價一致，早段曾跌穿招股價，一度低於招股價約一成。股份公開發售部分錄得約4.6倍超額認購，一手中籤率約百分之18.4。國際發售超購近1.6倍。集資淨額接近136億元，用於提升技術能力和品牌知名度等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-0945_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RCNTwjvD9t1788237656.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO-0945_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">智能機械人組件供應商梅卡曼德機器人開報101.7元，與招股價一致，早段曾跌穿招股價，一度低於招股價逾百分之3。股份公開發售部分錄得約3,834倍超額認購，一手中籤率百分之3，國際發售超購逾12倍。集資淨額22億元，用於為產品和技術的研發提供資金等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T04:58:37.289285+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}